WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.835
I spoke to Tish the
other day

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:04.295
and she’s agreed to
consider meeting you

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:05.547
- wow!

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.841
Your psychic has actually
agreed to let me pay her

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:09.759
a lot of money to 
speak with her?

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.136
Amazing!

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:13.304
Well no, she’s 
considering it

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:15.974
But I think you meeting Latisha
would be perfect

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:19.394
because, well, you are 
in need of desperate

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.312
need of some maternal
guidance

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:22.522
Just a minute, there's
a group of people

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.858
gathering outside for
scream therapy, which

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.651
is my favorite bit.

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:29.487
So I better go now, because
I mustn't use my voice.

00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:30.321
Bye-bye, sausage.

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:31.364
You call me.

